From 03ef78286f33b5d268e664d1382d0e422a2bbee0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 14:55:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] [tests/gtest]: refactor model test body into type
 conversion and message sending functions

Separates test body code into modularized functions, consisting of the
following:

- Type conversion functions from the model format parsed from JSON to
  FRR internal data structures.
- Message sending functions for notifying the test environment BGP
  instance about advertised link-state information.
- Utility functions for parsing and validating ISO sys IDs and IPv6
  addresses in each model test case.

Signed-off-by: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
